00:10:22,857 --> 00:10:28,857
White Chicks is a comedy, crime film directed by Keenen Ivory Wayans.

3
00:15:34,285 --> 00:15:40,285
Two FBI agent brothers, Marcus and Kevin
Copeland, accidentally foil a drug bust.

4
00:20:45,714 --> 00:20:51,714
To avoid being fired they accept a mission escorting a pair of socialites to the
Hamptons--but when the girls are disfigured in a car accident, they refuse to go.

5
00:25:57,142 --> 00:26:03,142
Left without options, Marcus and Kevin decide to pose as the sisters,
transforming themselves from black men into rich white women.

